=== (a) first-moment boost, 1D lattice KG, exact ===
P = sin(k)   F = sqrt(m**2 - 2*cos(k) + 2)*cos(k)
F - H(1-(H^2-m^2)/2) at H=w : 0
Casimir C = P^2 - 2*int F dH ; dC along flow: 0

